        264.09747314453125,
        136.36285400390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "480da4f7740ae6d0970bf699f3a89ffcb6b06997829ad6e5d31fdbfdd9821bb1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Quicker onset and shorter duration of action \nthan lorazepam or diazepam.\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.0050048828125,
        107.6528549194336,
        418.6126403808594,
        126.35784912109375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d49f286fe0a7b27c4e60d4e633bea19b40313b6da37fd69cadcbf2348869ce61"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "IV administration should only be used \n(usually as a last resort) with extreme \ncaution and where resuscitation facilities are \navailable.\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.0050048828125,
        133.64784240722656,
        417.3525695800781,
        172.34783935546875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "0e2fbe3afef976985641e3284aa49e2152363bd5396bedfb21bc63447a9b42b4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "Shorter onset and duration of action than \nhaloperidol\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.0050048828125,
        179.63783264160156,
        409.45513916015625,
        198.34283447265625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ecbd71d5f7d432f90b78cbb83ca450fc2d006101b581752ff19199766262030f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "When given as buccal liquid, onset of action \nis 15–30 minutes.13 Some published data in \nmental health but only in adults.14 Buccal \nliquid is unlicensed for this use.\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.0010986328125,
        205.63282775878906,
        417.36761474609375,
        244.37289428710938
      ],
      "text_sha256": "18c7e2b18238a75b1a32ef5fbd9fe8f22c32d2690d875fda6c3e1208f1de25a3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "Diazepam* IV\n(not for IM \nadministration)15\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.00360107421875,
        250.68788146972656,
        100.77901458740234,
        279.390380859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d995f89cd9fbfee1a6c766bf86e921609e7c0737f5f5a52fb19d1b2ddf508262"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "0.1mg/kg/dose by slow IV \ninjection.\nMax 40mg total daily \ndose <12 years and \n60mg >12 years\n",
      "bbox": [
        117.0,
        250.69288635253906,
        201.61502075195312,
        299.390380859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4f202be694c7ad8e107e92ce9d2e207e3f1e7958433683fe99792364be1b86e2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "1–3 minutes\nLong half-life that does not correlate with \nlength of sedation. Possibility of \naccumulation\n",
      "bbox": [
        212.00250244140625,
        250.6853790283203,
        409.29754638671875,
        279.38787841796875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "73faab6f5b3faf38e7a13319a736831343d3b52d6e6a571638efa8d67c3e9ba8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Never give as IM injection\n",
      "bbox": [
        274.0050048828125,
        286.49786376953125,
        365.27996826171875,
        295.3853759765625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e9448d5f1d45ca2d9294a0cb876ecc3142d099579352746d93eed673b0014c8c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "Ziprasidone IM16–19\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.00750732421875,
        305.70538330078125,
        107.00257873535156,
        314.4128723144531
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d6e9830c95d897f21ae7be7fa2c9087eebe02f50a31257c4ccba2451187b0de8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0618-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "(not UK)\n",
